<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech utility JME 1996 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Czech utility JME 1996 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech utility Jihomoravska Energetika a.s. said on Friday that, according to preliminary results, it posted a 420 million crown net profit for 1996, down from 510 million crowns the previous year.  </p>
<p>JME said in a statement that gross profit for 1996 was 565.6 million crowns on revenues of 11.95 billion. In 1995, the firm posted a gross profit of 808.8 million crowns on revenues of 11.23 billion.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
